    <string name="termux_guide_title">S24 Ultra &amp; Termux Guide</string>
    <string name="termux_guide_msg">How to access your videos on Galaxy S24 Ultra:\n\n1. In Termux (Command line):\n• Run: termux-setup-storage\n• Your exported gallery videos are in:\n  ~/storage/movies/SearchVPN\n• Your public downloads are in:\n  ~/storage/downloads\n\n2. In Samsung Gallery:\n• Open Samsung Gallery → Albums tab → look for the \"SearchVPN\" album.\n\n3. In Samsung My Files App:\n• Internal storage → Movies → SearchVPN\n\nTip: You can use mpv in Termux: \"pkg install mpv &amp;&amp; mpv ~/storage/movies/SearchVPN/your_video.mp4\"</string>

